<title>UK: UK's Austin Reed raises H1 profits.</title>
<headline>UK's Austin Reed raises H1 profits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>28 weeks to August 10</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		4.9		    vs 3.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.25		   vs 2.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.3		    vs 1.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   38.9		   vs 36.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Clothing retailer Austin Reed Group Plc said in a statement it expects &quot;further steady progress&quot; in the second half of the year.</p>
</text>
